Title: Forever Leveling BiS source order reachable (for MeioBiSExtras' /bisorder)
Why: the Best in slot tab lists its sources (Quest, Dungeon, Crafted, BoE, Vendor, PvP in v1.4.4) in the
order of ns.SourceTypes, a table in the addon's private namespace. Exposed as a global so the overlay can
reorder it in place before the window is built (Settings' source cards follow the same table). Anchored
on the start of the labels line so a new source type doesn't break it.

=== FILE ForeverLevelingBiS\Scoring.lua
=== INLINE
--- OLD
ns.SourceLabels = {
--- NEW
ForeverLevelingBiS_SourceTypes = ns.SourceTypes -- LOCAL FIX: LevelingBiSExtras reorders it
ns.SourceLabels = {
=== END
